        {
          "title": "ZAYA1-8B Technical Report",
          "title_zh": "ZAYA1-8B 技术报告",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2605.05365v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "models_embeddings",
          "organization": "Zyphra",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2605.05365",
          "summary": "ZAYA1-8B is a reasoning-focused mixture-of-experts model with 8B total and 700M active parameters whose core pretraining, midtraining and supervised fine-tuning ran on a full-stack AMD platform; it matches or exceeds DeepSeek-R1-0528 on several math and coding benchmarks. A test-time method called Markovian RSA lifts it to 91.9% on AIME'25 and 89.6% on HMMT'25 while carrying forward only a 4K-token reasoning tail.",
