        {
          "title": "Securing the Agent: Vendor-Neutral, Multitenant Enterprise Retrieval and Tool Use",
          "title_zh": "保护智能体：厂商中立、多租户的企业级检索与工具调用",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2605.05287v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "OpenAI",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2605.05287",
          "summary": "The paper formalizes how relevance-ranked RAG can surface one tenant's confidential documents to another and proposes layered isolation with policy-aware ingestion, retrieval-time gating and server-side agentic orchestration. An open-source OGX implementation shows that attribute-based access control eliminates cross-tenant leakage with negligible overhead.",
